§§ `s 16 -- other proceedings`

-- s 16(1): a claim cannot be lodged if (a) proceedings about it are pending in, or were decided by, another court or an Industrial Arbitration Court, or (b) a claim under section 119 of the Employment Act 1968 is pending, or the Commissioner decided the dispute under section 115.
-- src:1059 | 16.—(1) A claim relating to a specified employment dispute cannot
